ssure indicators clearly at the top of the mobile screen.","touchAndInput":"Provide responsive virtual joystick and clearly delineated touch buttons for gathering, attacking, and inventory management.","readability":"Ensure text fonts, UI layouts, and VFX particle densities do not obstruct enemy threat signals or core gameplay visibility.","accessibility":"Incorporate high-contrast visual cues and distinct audio feedback to assist players in identifying danger states and combat hits."},"mobileUx":"가상 조이스틱과 직관적인 터치 인터페이스를 통해 복잡한 조작 없이도 이동, 채집, 전투가 원활하게 이루어지도록 최적화된 레이아웃."},"referencePatterns":[{"id":"BUILD_PRESETS","game":"Genshin Impact","sourceUrl":"https://genshin.hoyoverse.com/en/news/detail/156641","observedAt":"2026-10-07","principle":"Save and switch a player-selected equipment setup.","adaptation":"Compare changes before applying; preserve unavailable-item, combat and save restrictions.","authority":"DESIGN_REFERENCE_ONLY","runtimeVerified":false},{"id":"CONDITIONAL_LOOT_FILTER","game":"Diablo IV","sourceUrl":"https://news.blizzard.com/en-us/article/24267729/prepare-for-the-reckoning-lord-of-hatred-draws-near","observedAt":"2026-10-07","principle":"Reusable conditions reduce irrelevant loot information; filters can be shared.","adaptation":"Expose filter state and reset; filtering must not delete rewards or silently auto-sell.","authority":"DESIGN_REFERENCE_ONLY","runtimeVerified":false},{"id":"QUEST_CONTEXT_SHORTCUT","game":"Genshin Impact","sourceUrl":"https://genshin.hoyoverse.com/en/news/detail/157683","observedAt":"2026-10-07","principle":"A quest can offer the relevant time adjustment directly.","adaptation":"Deep-link to the existing permitted action and return to the same quest/filter/scroll position; never bypass quest prerequisites.","authority":"DESIGN_REFERENCE_ONLY","runtimeVerified":false},{"id":"TRAVEL_FAVORITES","game":"No Man's Sky","sourceUrl":"https://www.nomanssky.com/worlds-part-ii-update/","observedAt":"2026-10-07","principle":"Favorite d